# crypto-config/, channel-artifacts/ and geschannel.block are INTENTIONALLY
# committed (not ignored) — this repo is private, and Railway's per-service
# isolated filesystems mean each Fabric service's Docker image needs this
# material baked in at build time (no shared-volume mechanism across
# services like local Docker Compose has). Do not flip this repo to public
# without removing this material from history first.

# ── Private keys (never commit these) ────────────────────────────────────
*_sk
priv_sk
*.key

# ── Chaincode runtime files ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# chaincode.env is written by deploy-chaincode.sh on each install.
# The CHAINCODE_ID inside it changes every time — do not commit.
chaincode.env

# ── Compiled chaincode binary ─────────────────────────────────────────────
chaincode/ges-verify/ges-verify
*.tar.gz

# ── Ledger data (Docker volumes) ──────────────────────────────────────────
ledger-data/

# ── OS / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
*.swp
